{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "grp-title",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -80,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 200,
      "label": "testagent — Wiz & Pattern Catalogue ADK"
    },
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#24477f",
      "text": "## Current use case\n\n**Cloud security + Terraform delivery:** query **Wiz** (posture, vulns, inventory), author infra with **Pattern Catalogue** (approved modules), **persist files** under `agent_output/`, **scan IaC** with **wizcli**, and **convert CloudFormation → Terraform** then align with catalog modules.\n\nRun from repo root: `./run_adk_web.sh` — select agent **`cloud_security_iac_delivery.agent`** (registered name **`Cloud_Security_IaC_Delivery`**; `&` is not allowed in ADK agent names)."
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-config",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 280,
      "label": "Configuration"
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "### Env (`.env` at repo root)\n\n- `GOOGLE_API_KEY` + `ADK_MODEL` (Gemini)\n- `LLM_PROVIDER=gemini` if needed\n- **Wiz MCP:** `WIZ_MCP_REMOTE_URL` (mcp-remote + `~/.mcp-auth`)\n- **Pattern Catalogue:** `PATCAT_MCP_REMOTE_URL` or `PATCAT_MCP_URL`\n- Optional: `MCP_SESSION_TIMEOUT`, tool filters"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-agent",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 280,
      "label": "ADK agent"
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-core",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#24477f",
      "text": "### `root_agent`\n\n- **Name:** `Cloud_Security_IaC_Delivery`\n- **Tools:** Wiz MCP + PatCat MCP (if configured) + 6 function tools\n- **Instruction:** PatCat first for TF; Wiz MCP for security data; wizcli for local/Git scans; save files to workspace."
    },
    {
      "id": "f-agent",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 56,
      "file": "cloud_security_iac_delivery/agent.py"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-mcp",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 280,
      "label": "MCP (remote / HTTP)"
    },
    {
      "id": "mcp-wiz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "### Wiz MCP\n\nVulnerabilities, findings, inventory, posture — use **tool schemas** from the server.\n\nOAuth via `npx mcp-remote`; tokens under `~/.mcp-auth`."
    },
    {
      "id": "mcp-patcat",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### Pattern Catalogue MCP\n\nDiscover **modules / parameters** for AWS & Azure TF. **Prefer catalog modules** over hand-rolled `aws_*` when generating Terraform."
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-local",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 420,
      "label": "Host tools (function)"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-wizcli",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### Wiz CLI\n\n`scan_local_terraform_code` · `scan_github_terraform_repository`\n\nAuth: **device code** or `WIZ_CLIENT_ID` / `WIZ_CLIENT_SECRET` (not MCP token)."
    },
    {
      "id": "local-fs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "### Workspace\n\n`write_local_workspace_file` · `read_*` · `list_*` → default **`agent_output/`**"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-cfn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### CFN → Terraform\n\n`convert_cloudformation_template_to_terraform`\n\nWrites `main.tf` / `variables.tf` / `outputs.tf` + **`PATTERN_CATALOG.md`**. Then use **PatCat MCP** to swap in approved modules."
    },
    {
      "id": "f-cfn",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 50,
      "file": "cloud_security_iac_delivery/cfn_terraform_tools.py"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-artifacts",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 200,
      "label": "Artifacts & samples"
    },
    {
      "id": "artifacts",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "### On disk\n\n| Path | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `agent_output/terraform/` | Generated TF, CFN samples, ECS CloudFormation YAML |\n| `ecs-converted-*` / `cfn-from-*` | CFN converter output |\n| `static-website/`, `lambda-vulnerable/` | Example stacks |\n\nOptional: `scan_local_terraform_code` on these paths after **wizcli** login."
    },
    {
      "id": "f-readme",
      "type": "file",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 50,
      "file": "README.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "f-run",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 140,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 50,
      "file": "run_adk_web.sh"
    },
    {
